-- ===== 900300 THE FORGE-WARDEN OF ISPAR =====
-- Base: the retail Bronze Gauntlet Knight (87253, motion table 0x090001A8, sounds 0x200000D3,
-- wields a Gearknight Greatsword/Sword) on the dark iron golem body 0x0200194B (UNUSED-ASSETS find 3).
-- KIT-BASH (anim parts; both clients draw them, and it animates on the golem rig):
--   part 16 (the golem body has no head mesh, 0x010001EC) -> 0x01004322, the Aetherium Power Core
